# Every text file in this repo is LF, on every platform. Without this, Git for
# Windows' common core.autocrlf=true checks the scripts out with CRLF, and they
# fail under bash with `$'\r': command not found` (an allowlist fragment with
# CRLF silently allows nothing). host-preflight.sh refuses a CRLF checkout; this
# prevents one.
* text=auto eol=lf
